    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington is delighted to present this two-bedroom redbrick home in the heart of The Tenters. Set over three levels with a converted attic, the house combines period features with flexible living space and a bright kitchen to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe entrance hall leads to a front living room with timber floors, decorative ceiling detail and a fireplace. A separate dining room connects to the kitchen, where rooflights and glazed doors bring in natural light and open onto the rear outdoor area. A guest WC completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nThere are two bedrooms and a family bathroom on the first floor. The converted attic provides a further room with an en-suite.\r\nDonore Road is in an ideal setting. It is within a 15-minute walk of the City Centre and there are excellent cafés, bars and restaurants within a 5-minute walk such as Marlowe & Co, The Headline Bar, Gaillot Et Grey, Bastible and Noshington café. \r\n\r\nThe Camden Street area is within a 10-minute walk offering an even wider selection. Local schools include St. Catherine's, Griffith Barracks, Synge Street and Presentation Primary School. Regular bus routes service the area and the LUAS is within walking distance also."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor: \r\nEntrance hall \r\nLiving room: 2.89m × 4.59m\r\nDining room: 2.97m × 2.55m\r\nKitchen: 4.48m × 3.39m\r\nGuest WC.\r\n\r\nFirst floor: \r\nBedroom One: 3.96m × 2.48m\r\nBedroom Two: 2.73m × 3.44m\r\nFamily bathroom: 1.65m × 1.89m\r\n\r\nConverted attic:  3.25m × 3.96m with en-suite 1.26m × 1.32m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tRedbrick façade and period fireplaces\r\n•\tTwo bedrooms and a converted attic space with en-suite\r\n•\tSeparate living and dining rooms\r\n•\tBright rear kitchen with rooflights and glazed doors to the outdoor area\r\n•\tRear laneway access\r\n•\tExcellent location and within walking distance to Dublin City Centre"
      },
